        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Aux codes two (2) through six (6) require prior Supervisory approval. Failure to get Supervisory approval could result in disciplinary action. Aux 9 is used for miscellaneous paper work or bathroom break. Aux 9 does not require Supervisory approval. Aux 9 is used to calculated staff time and the 30 minute authorized time equates to 93% staffed.",
